{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find an object, move to it, take it, check its features, and perform a task based on them. list of available nodes: <Action ID = FindObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ScanObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFeature1    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFeature2    /> <Action ID = DoFeature1Task    /> <Action ID = DoFeature2Task    />",
